`Makefile.env` includes `$(ROOTDIR)/common.env` → `/common.env` (missing). Also, for the `precommit` goal, the BRANCH-dependent `$(error Invalid BRANCH...)` only triggers for goals `build upload clean apply buca` — precommit is not in that list, so no error from BRANCH.

The…
